<title>JAPAN: Volks -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Volks -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.85		vs	   15.26</p>
<p> Operating	  187    million	  vs	  566    million</p>
<p> Current	    190    million	  vs	  547    million</p>
<p> Net		   17    million	  vs	  117    million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.94 yen	  vs	    7.08 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     19 million	  vs	  19 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Volks Inc is a leading steak house chain operator.</p>
</text>
